      <item>
        <title>Hackathon Tiime</title>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SimpleSAMLphp Hackathon&lt;/strong&gt;: On 30 January 2024 there will be a hackathon open to all interested in improving SimpleSAMLphp. It will take place in Copenhagen, co-hosted with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://tiime-unconference.eu/&quot;&gt;TIIME unconference&lt;/a&gt; on identity. Please &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.conferencemanager.dk/tiime/signup&quot;&gt;get a side meeting ticket&lt;/a&gt; at the TIIME website if you want to participate.&lt;/p&gt;

</description>
        <pubDate>Fri, 10 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        <link>https://simplesamlphp.org/2023/11/10/Hackathon-tiime.html</link>
        <guid isPermaLink="true">https://simplesamlphp.org/2023/11/10/Hackathon-tiime.html</guid>
        
        
